          "cookies": [],
          "content": {
            "size": 7546,
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "text": "{\n  \"session\": {\n    \"name\": \"collections/default_collection/engines/gemini-enterprise-17812649_1781265009861/sessions/12285753865510889048\",\n    \"state\": \"IN_PROGRESS\",\n    \"userPseudoId\": \"12285753865510889048\",\n    \"turns\": [\n      {\n        \"query\": {\n          \"queryId\": \"10098338460993686026\",\n          \"text\": \"Generate ideas for a unique customer experience.\",\n          \"parts\": [\n            {\n              \"text\": \"Generate ideas for a unique customer experience.\"\n            }\n          ]\n        },\n        \"assistAnswer\": \"collections/default_collection/engines/gemini-enterprise-17812649_1781265009861/sessions/12285753865510889048/assistAnswers/10098338460993685006\",\n        \"detailedAssistAnswer\": {\n          \"name\": \"collections/default_collection/engines/gemini-enterprise-17812649_1781265009861/sessions/12285753865510889048/assistAnswers/10098338460993685006\",\n          \"state\": \"SUCCEEDED\",\n          \"replies\": [\n            {\n              \"groundedContent\": {\n                \"content\": {\n                  \"role\": \"model\",\n                  \"text\": \"Okay, I've drafted the requirements for developing a groundbreaking and memorable customer experience. Let me know if you have any suggestions!\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"agent\": \"default_idea_generation\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"groundedContent\": {\n                \"content\": {\n                  \"role\": \"model\",\n                  \"text\": \"# Unique Customer Experience\\n\\n## Goal:\\nDevelop a groundbreaking and memorable customer experience that significantly differentiates a business from its competitors and fosters strong customer loyalty.\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\n* The idea must offer a truly novel and distinctive approach to customer interaction, moving beyond conventional methods.\\n* The experience must genuinely enhance customer satisfaction, engagement, and overall perception of value.\\n* The idea should be feasible to implement within a reasonable scope for a typical business, considering resources and technology.\\n* The experience should be memorable and shareable, encouraging positive word-of-mouth and brand advocacy.\\n* The idea should address an unmet customer need, resolve a common pain point, or create new, unexpected value.\\n* The experience should be adaptable to various business types or contexts (e.g., online, retail, service-based).\\n\\n## Attributes\\n\\n* **Novelty Score:** Rate the novelty of the idea compared to existing solutions on a scale of 1 to 5 (1 - common, 3 - moderately novel, 5 - revolutionary).\\n* **Customer Impact Score:** Assess the potential of this idea to significantly improve customer satisfaction and engagement on a scale of 1 to 5 (1 - minor impact, 3 - moderate impact, 5 - transformative impact).\\n* **Feasibility Score:** Rate the ease of implementation for a typical business on a scale of 1 to 5 (1 - very complex/costly, 3 - moderate complexity/cost, 5 - relatively simple/low cost).\\n* **Primary Value Prop:** Identify the main value proposition this experience offers to the customer (e.g., Convenience, Delight, Personalization, Efficiency, Community, Exclusivity).\\n* **Target Industry:** Specify the primary industry or context where this experience would be most applicable (e.g., Retail, SaaS, Hospitality, Healthcare, Finance).\\n\\n## Criteria\\n\\n* **Idea correctness:** Required\\n* **Idea novelty:** Required\\n* **Maximize impact:** Yes\"\n                },\n                \"contentMetadata\": {\n                  \"contentKind\": \"RESEARCH_PLAN\"\n                }\n              },\n              \"agent\": \"default_idea_generation\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"diagnosticInfo\": {\n            \"plannerSteps\": [\n              {\n                \"queryStep\": {\n                  \"parts\": [\n                    {\n                      \"text\": \"Generate ideas for a unique customer experience.\"\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              },\n              {\n                \"planStep\": {\n                  \"parts\": [\n                    {\n                      \"text\": \"Okay, I've drafted the requirements for developing a groundbreaking and memorable customer experience. Let me know if you have any suggestions!\"\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              },\n              {\n                \"planStep\": {\n                  \"parts\": [\n                    {\n                      \"text\": \"# Unique Customer Experience\\n\\n## Goal:\\nDevelop a groundbreaking and memorable customer experience that significantly differentiates a business from its competitors and fosters strong customer loyalty.\\n\\n## Requirements\\n\\n* The idea must offer a truly novel and distinctive approach to customer interaction, moving beyond conventional methods.\\n* The experience must genuinely enhance customer satisfaction, engagement, and overall perception of value.\\n* The idea should be feasible to implement within a reasonable scope for a typical business, considering resources and technology.\\n* The experience should be memorable and shareable, encouraging positive word-of-mouth and brand advocacy.\\n* The idea should address an unmet customer need, resolve a common pain point, or create new, unexpected value.\\n* The experience should be adaptable to various business types or contexts (e.g., online, retail, service-based).\\n\\n## Attributes\\n\\n* **Novelty Score:** Rate the novelty of the idea compared to existing solutions on a scale of 1 to 5 (1 - common, 3 - moderately novel, 5 - revolutionary).\\n* **Customer Impact Score:** Assess the potential of this idea to significantly improve customer satisfaction and engagement on a scale of 1 to 5 (1 - minor impact, 3 - moderate impact, 5 - transformative impact).\\n* **Feasibility Score:** Rate the ease of implementation for a typical business on a scale of 1 to 5 (1 - very complex/costly, 3 - moderate complexity/cost, 5 - relatively simple/low cost).\\n* **Primary Value Prop:** Identify the main value proposition this experience offers to the customer (e.g., Convenience, Delight, Personalization, Efficiency, Community, Exclusivity).\\n* **Target Industry:** Specify the primary industry or context where this experience would be most applicable (e.g., Retail, SaaS, Hospitality, Healthcare, Finance).\\n\\n## Criteria\\n\\n* **Idea correctness:** Required\\n* **Idea novelty:** Required\\n* **Maximize impact:** Yes\"\n                    }\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"turnId\": \"12285753865510889048_10098338460993685771\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-06-26T10:31:29.282494122Z\",\n        \"queryConfig\": {\n          \"google.discoveryengine.googleapis.com.Assistant.model_id\": \"\",\n          \"google.discoveryengine.googleapis.com.Assistant.tools_spec\": \"{\\\"toolRegistry\\\":\\\"default_tool_registry\\\"}\",\n          \"google.discoveryengine.googleapis.com.Assistant.answer_generation_mode\": \"IDEA_FORGE\"\n        },\n        \"assistToken\": \"NMwKDAjkqfnRBhCbj7eJARIkNmEzZTJmNjAtMDAwMC0yYWRhLWE0YzItZmM0MTE2OTJiMDQ5\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"startTime\": \"2026-06-26T10:30:59.732223Z\",\n    \"endTime\": \"2026-06-26T10:31:30.155142Z\",\n    \"displayName\": \"Unique customer experience\",\n    \"labels\": [\n      \"ideaforge\"\n    ],\n    \"ideaForgeInstance\": \"projects/102364069938/locations/global/collections/default_collection/engines/gemini-enterprise-17812649_1781265009861/sessions/12285753865510889048/ideaForgeInstances/17925524613743640220\",\n    \"expireTime\": \"2026-08-25T10:30:59.062850551Z\"\n  }\n}\n"
          },
