            "text": "{\n  \"ideaForgeInstance\": {\n    \"name\": \"collections/default_collection/engines/gemini-enterprise-17812649_1781265009861/sessions/3175272820855802029/ideaForgeInstances/6490452448859968618\",\n    \"config\": {\n      \"userInput\": \"Develop solutions for a predictive supply chain optimization tool.\",\n      \"title\": \"Predictive Supply Chain Optimization Solutions\",\n      \"goal\": \"Propose a novel and impactful solution for predictive supply chain optimization.\",\n      \"attributes\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"Problem Area\",\n          \"extractor\": \"Specific supply chain problem or function addressed (e.g., 'Demand Forecasting', 'Inventory Management', 'Logistics Routing', 'Supplier Risk').\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"Core Predictive Model\",\n          \"extractor\": \"Primary predictive model or technique used (e.g., 'Time Series Analysis', 'Machine Learning Classification', 'Neural Networks', 'Simulation').\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"Optimization Metric\",\n          \"extractor\": \"Key performance indicator (KPI) the solution primarily aims to optimize (e.g., 'Cost Reduction', 'On-time Delivery', 'Resilience', 'Carbon Footprint').\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"Data Dependency\",\n          \"extractor\": \"Describe the primary types of data required for the solution to function effectively (e.g., 'Historical Sales Data', 'IoT Sensor Data', 'Weather Data', 'Social Media Trends').\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"Novelty\",\n          \"extractor\": \"Rate the novelty of the proposed solution on a scale of 1 to 5 (1 - common, 3 - moderately new, 5 - groundbreaking).\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"Feasibility\",\n          \"extractor\": \"Rate the practical feasibility of implementing this solution given current technology and resources on a scale of 1 to 5 (1 - highly theoretical, 3 - moderately challenging, 5 - readily implementable).\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"Impact Potential\",\n          \"extractor\": \"Rate the potential business impact (e.g., cost savings, efficiency gains, risk reduction) of the solution on a scale of 1 to 5 (1 - minor, 3 - significant, 5 - transformative).\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"preferences\": [\n        \"The solution must leverage predictive analytics to anticipate future supply chain events.\",\n        \"The solution must aim to optimize specific aspects of the supply chain (e.g., cost, inventory, logistics, resilience, sustainability).\",\n        \"The solution should be practical and conceptually implementable within a real-world business context.\",\n        \"The solution should be data-driven, indicating potential data sources or types required.\"\n      ],\n      \"predefinedGenerationConfig\": {\n        \"type\": \"TIER1\"\n      },\n      \"shouldBeCorrect\": true,\n      \"shouldBeNovel\": true,\n      \"shouldMaximizeImpact\": true\n    },\n    \"state\": \"GENERATING_FOCUS_AREAS\",\n    \"metadata\": {\n      \"createTime\": \"2026-06-26T10:27:08.772614Z\",\n      \"startTime\": \"2026-06-26T10:27:15.108361464Z\"\n    },\n    \"stats\": {\n      \"numIdeas\": 29\n    },\n    \"ideaPreviews\": [\n      {\n        \"ideaForgeIdea\": \"collections/default_collection/engines/gemini-enterprise-17812649_1781265009861/sessions/3175272820855802029/ideaForgeInstances/6490452448859968618/ideaForgeIdeas/11013678763866752936\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"ideaForgeIdea\": \"collections/default_collection/engines/gemini-enterprise-17812649_1781265009861/sessions/3175272820855802029/ideaForgeInstances/6490452448859968618/ideaForgeIdeas/11766915190844889237\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"ideaForgeIdea\": \"collections/default_collection/engines/gemini-enterprise-17812649_1781265009861/sessions/3175272820855802029/ideaForgeInstances/6490452448859968618/ideaForgeIdeas/11786038070541015928\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"idea